{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/b63c089edea2145b36f6ddb8ac8fac37.poster.avif?t=1773838369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/b63c089edea2145b36f6ddb8ac8fac37.webm?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/b63c089edea2145b36f6ddb8ac8fac37.mp4?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of galactic warriors plummet through a cosmic rift. They must blast, slash, and laser hostile lifeforms as they dimension hop to freedom across a series of planets. They must loot everything they can to arm themselves against the entity lurking deep within the Rift. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like Risk of Rain and Nuclear Throne we hope to give you a challenging experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/7386966e0ed572604dc8d6d11756ef47.poster.avif?t=1773838369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/7386966e0ed572604dc8d6d11756ef47.webm?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/7386966e0ed572604dc8d6d11756ef47.mp4?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through swarms of lifeforms seeking to destroy you in procedurally generated levels. Each set of lifeforms possess synergistic move sets to challenge you per level. As time increases per level the stronger your enemies become. Once you beat the final boss (if you can) continue the run to see how many loops you can complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/f95b17925e364d8f22683314b0bd2e0a.poster.avif?t=1773838369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/f95b17925e364d8f22683314b0bd2e0a.webm?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/f95b17925e364d8f22683314b0bd2e0a.mp4?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INFANTRY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 5 playable characters. Each character is equipped with unique sets of abilities. Unlock and find which combination of abilities works best for you. Also each character possess a hidden power to give them an edge during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/dcb091c473fc6a9161f6b73a169cc085.poster.avif?t=1773838369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/dcb091c473fc6a9161f6b73a169cc085.webm?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/extras/dcb091c473fc6a9161f6b73a169cc085.mp4?t=1773838369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENHANCEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over a 100 items to arm yourself with powerful effects to assist with combat. Whenever you level up equip one of three perks to amplify your abilities. Craft unique builds on the fly by combining the effects of items and perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique characters with distinct unlockable move sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a 100 of items and perks to select. Effects ranging from basic like chain lightning to orbital lasers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation:  Items/perks, level layouts, enemy distribution, etc... all will change.\u00a0No run will be the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact Runs: Gameplay designed to be quick, but challenging.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955060?t=1773838369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955060?t=1773838369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/da40d774473980d6cce67c2c9d2a71b0f2171a2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773838369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955060/da40d774473980d6cce67c2c9d2a71b0f2171a2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773838369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s